"category":"other","ingredientGroup":"Color","uniiCode":null,"alternateNames":[],"forms":[]},{"order":12,"ingredientId":16393,"name":"Annatto","category":"botanical","ingredientGroup":"Annatto","uniiCode":null,"alternateNames":[],"forms":[]},{"order":13,"ingredientId":20983,"name":"Turmeric","category":"botanical","ingredientGroup":"Color","uniiCode":null,"alternateNames":[],"forms":[]}]},"pdf":"","percentDvFootnote":"Percent Daily Values are based on a 2,000 calorie diet.","physicalState":{"langualCode":"E0162","langualCodeDescription":"Powder"},"productType":{"langualCode":"A1325","langualCodeDescription":"Other Combinations"},"productVersionCode":"CODE 386564 HSG","servingSizes":[{"order":1,"minQuantity":67.5,"maxQuantity":67.5,"minDailyServings":1,"maxDailyServings":2,"unit":"Gram(s)","notes":"2 scoops","inSFB":true}],"servingsPerContainer":"22","src":"api/label/220082","statements":[{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"30% increase in muscle strength in just 8 weeks"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"An 8-week, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled study of 33 healthy men compared the effectiveness of this proprietary module of whey protein and leucine vs. an isocaloric carbohydrate placebo consumed before and after resistance training. Subjects consuming the leucine-whey protein supplement experienced greater increases in muscle strength than those on the placebo. Leucine-whey protein supplementation also increased muscle cross-sectional area from baseline."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"When used in conjunction with an exercise program.\nIn an 8-week, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled study of 30 healthy male volunteers comparing 1 set resistance training (RT) + active or carbohydrate placebo to 2 sets RT alone with no supplement, the active group showed equal gains in maximal muscle strength and muscle endurance compared to the control group."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"In a randomized, double-blind crossover clinical trial that included 20 recreationally trained, healthy male subjects, those taking 10 g whey protein isolate plus 10 g leucine immediately post-workout showed significant increases in key protein (p70S6k & rpS6) associated with muscle protein synthesis."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Proven to increase muscle strength & size in just 8 weeks\nEnhanced for intense energy & metabolism support"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"40g Protein\n15g BCAA\n10g Leucine\n1g Velositol\n150 mg Caffeine\nChocolate Fudge Natural + artificial flavors"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Directions: As a dietary supplement, consume 2 scoops in 8 fl. oz. of cold water or your favorite beverage. Wheybolic Ripped can be consumed first thing in the morning, pre-workout, and/or post-workout. For maximum results, reference usage benefits  and consume 2 rounded scoops twice daily. Do not consume close to bedtime."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Contains: Milk and Soybeans."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Warning: Consult your physician prior to using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, taking medication, or have a medical condition."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Discontinue use two weeks prior to surgery."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Gluten Free."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Notice: Use this product as a food supplement only. Do not use for weight reduction."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Significant product settling may occur."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"ProHydrolase is a trademark of Deerland Enzymes, Inc.\nVelositol and its associated logo is a trademark of Nutrition 21, LLC. Velositol is patented protected."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"GF Gluten free"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Banned Substance Free"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Superior performance protein\nEnhanced with More Leucine & BCAA than Standard Whey Protein\nElevated Muscle Fuel with a Premium 4:1:1 BCAA Ratio for Muscle Growth & Recovery\nFeatures Only Premium, Ultra-Pure, Fast-Absorbing Protein\nOnly Whey Hydrolysates and a Clinical Core of Whey Isolate & Leucine to Improve Strength & Post-Training Anabolic Response\nEnhanced with Velositol & Prohydrolase\nTo Accelerate Muscle Protein Synthesis & Absorption of Amino Acids for Efficient Use by Muscles\nFeaturing a Thermo Ripped Matrix with Caffeine, L-Carnitine & Key Electrolytes"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Supporting intense energy, mental focus, fatty acid metabolism & superior hydration\nUsage benefits\nFor Pre-Workout & Cardio\nClinically Proven Support for Strength, Performance & Stamina"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"For Post-Workout & Cardio\nProvides Fast-Absorbing Whey Isolate & Hydrolysates Plus BCAA to Fuel Anabolic Muscle Support & Recovery\nOn Non-Training Days & Between Meals\nProvides High-Quality Protein & Critical Amino Acids to Fuel Muscles while you Recover from Intense Training"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"If it's on our labels, then it's in our bottles. Full dosing, full transparency and no proprietary blends. Clinically studied ingredients backed by real science. The most effective and premium performance protein available. Get ripped."}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)","Gluten Free"],"thumbnail":"","upcSku":"0 48107 18213 7","userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"_source":"api"}